      <p source="#source-349-372"><seg source="#source-349-372">俥にゆられつつ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-372-398"><seg source="#source-372-398">夕ぐれ時の街道を</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-398-427"><seg source="#source-398-427">新町街道を急ぐ女よ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-427-456"><seg source="#source-427-456">眞赤な夕日は山の上</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-456-491"><seg source="#source-456-491">白粉のゑりがさむしかろ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-491-499"><seg source="#source-491-499">今宵</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-499-534"><seg source="#source-499-534">おん身の上に幸あれかし</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-534-594" style="padding-inline-start: 10em">
        <p source="#source-558-594"><seg source="#source-558-594">（一九一三・一〇・二〇）</seg></p>
